Niko
=====

Niko is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version: see
LICENSE. The authors are listed in AUTHORS.

The source of a release is the tag of its version in https://github.com/arngory/niko, with the repositories and
commits that tag names for its build:

- the core, sing-box: https://github.com/arngory/sing-box at COMMIT_SING_BOX (buildScript/lib/core/get_source_env.sh)
- the Go modules: libcore/go.mod and libcore/go.sum, as the Go module proxy serves them
- the slipstream client: https://github.com/arngory/slipstream at COMMIT_SLIPSTREAM (buildScript/lib/slipstream/env.sh)
  and its submodules, OpenSSL by the version its .github/scripts/android-openssl.sh names
- naive's network stack: the library modules of https://github.com/arngory/cronet-go that libcore/go.mod names


